			"Message": "feat(Worker): Add deepmerge-ts dependency for config merging\n\nAdd `deepmerge-ts` 7.1.5 as a production dependency to enable deep merging of TypeScript configuration objects in the Worker build pipeline.\n\nThe ESBuild bundler setup requires merging default configuration with worker-specific overrides across multiple config trees. The existing shallow spread pattern cannot handle nested objects (e.g., `define`, `plugins`, `loader` maps). `deepmerge-ts` provides type-safe, recursive merging without external runtime dependencies.\n\nPrepares the Worker package for upcoming ESBuild config composition — no source changes in this commit.",
			"SHA": "4f0fffe71c4c2f224d18c265b36654ee1e447a49"
		},
